                <mxCell id="aZ0WrSyEC6EXh-_T1yL0-89" value="Step 5. Summarizer Memory Write-back&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Evidence write:&lt;br&gt;mem-0013 = this question answer about North Sea mineral resources&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Experience written into mem-0010:&lt;br&gt;Reusable rule: For context-dependent attribute questions, resolve the entity first and keep only facts matching the requested attribute.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Concrete lesson from this case:&lt;br&gt;this sea → North Sea; answer mineral resources only; exclude fish/economy facts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Internal labels: attribute_lookup_with_context / pick_requested_attribute / avoid_mixed_attributes" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#939A96;strokeColor=#959D98;strokeWidth=1.4;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#123d22;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="aZ0WrSyEC6EXh-_T1yL0-83" vertex="1">
